#! ia 1.0

@schema package
  lowers to definition
  sections
    must have meaning
    must have package
    may have relationships
    closed
  fields
    must have meaning.says as text
    may have meaning.answers as text
    must have package.name as text "Manifest or module name of the package."
    must have package.path as text "Canonical repository-relative root directory of the package."
    must have package.layer as ref to layer
    may have package.kind as id in [host, contract, core, adapter, view, composition, tool]
    may have package.repository as ref to repository
  edges
    may require layer one
    may require package one-or-more
